    "htmlContent": "<p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;\"><strong>Personal Grooming:</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">Uniform, Hairnet, and Glove Protocols</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;\"><strong>Kitchen Sanitation:</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">Daily Deep-Cleaning Schedule</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">Oil Quality Monitoring & Disposal</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.6; color: #334155;\"><strong>Storage Protocols:</strong></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">FIFO (First-In, First-Out) Method</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569;\">Managing 1-Year Shelf Life Frozen Stock</p>"
